{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":1,"ref":"numbers 36:1","book":"numbers","lang":"tw","chapter":36,"translation":"Na efie akannifoɔ a wofi Gilad mma abusua mu — Makir ba, Menashe ba, a wɔyɛ Yosef mma abusua no mu bi — bɛnɛɛ hɔ, na wɔkasaawe wɔ Moshe anim, ne wɔn a wɔdi anim no anim, Israɛl mma efie akannifoɔ.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויקרבו","gloss":"na wɔbɛnɛɛ hɔ"},{"surface":"ראשי","gloss":"akannifoɔ"},{"surface":"האבות","gloss":"efie"},{"surface":"למשפחת","gloss":"abusua mu"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"mma"},{"surface":"גלעד","gloss":"Gilad"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"ba"},{"surface":"מכיר","gloss":"Makir"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"ba"},{"surface":"מנשה","gloss":"Menashe"},{"surface":"ממשפחת","gloss":"abusua mu"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"mma"},{"surface":"יוסף","gloss":"Yosef"},{"surface":"וידברו","gloss":"na wɔkasaawe"},{"surface":"לפני","gloss":"anim"},{"surface":"משה","gloss":"Moshe"},{"surface":"ולפני","gloss":"ne ... anim"},{"surface":"הנשאים","gloss":"wɔn a wɔdi anim"},{"surface":"ראשי","gloss":"akannifoɔ"},{"surface":"אבות","gloss":"efie"},{"surface":"לבני","gloss":"mma"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Israɛl"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-15T21:45:04.841850252Z","model":"glm-5.3"}